# Web Push (#267) — the VAPID PUBLIC key, public by design (it only identifies
# the sender). Set it to light up the "notify me when the app's closed" opt-in;
# leave it unset and the push surface stays hidden. The matching PRIVATE key is
# a true secret and must live only in the server function's secret store — never
# here, never any VITE_* var.
# VITE_VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=
